{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/equiterra-emaar-properties-grand-polo-club-and-resort","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1323,"crm_id":"3027","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Equiterra","slug":"equiterra-emaar-properties-grand-polo-club-and-resort","display_address":"Grand Polo Club and Resort","building_type":["townhouse"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":3500000,"display_price":"3.5M","lattitude":24.9737777627534,"longitude":55.2208384,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"3,4","about":"<p>Equiterra and Equiterra 2 at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/grand-club-resort-emaar-properties/\">Grand Polo Club &amp; Resort Dubai</a> are refined residential projects inspired by the elegance of equestrian living.&nbsp;</p><p>The developments feature 3 and 4-bedroom townhouses and 5-bedroom luxury residences, set amid polo fields, landscaped parks, and an exclusive clubhouse. With just a 10% down payment, these offer an inviting entry into Dubai’s equestrian-inspired lifestyle.</p><p>Designed to promote a sense of belonging, balance, and well-being, Equiterra and Equiterra 2 by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar Properties</a> combine elegant architecture with tranquil surroundings and strong investment potential.&nbsp;</p><p>The communities' thoughtful design and array of leisure and wellness spaces create a lifestyle defined by sophistication, connection, and lasting value.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_676f05e9ea.jpg","hash":"Feature_676f05e9ea","name":"  Equiterra Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3